          "description": "Learn animal names and the sounds they make, count along with the ducks at the pond, pretend to drive a tractor, and more! Take a moo-sical adventure down on the farm with Super Simple! This card includes 15 fun songs to brighten your day, including classic farm songs like “Old MacDonald” and “The Farmer In The Dell” along with Super Simple originals like “The Animals On The Farm” and “Driving In My Tractor”. It’s perfect for growing curious minds at home or in the classroom!",
